            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira mirongwitatu na gatandatu Asa ari ku ngoma, Bayasha umwami w’ Abisirayeli atera i Buyuda, yubaka i Rama, ngo yīmīre abaja kwa Asa umwami w’Abayuda, cank’ abavayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Asa abibonye, yābīra ku mafeza no ku mazahabu yari mu bubīko bgo mu ngoro y’ Uhoraho n’ubgo mu ngoro yiwe, ayarungikira Beni‐hadadi umwami w’i Siriya yaba i Damasiko; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amutumako, ut’ Urazi ko mwe na we mufitaniye isezerano, uti Nk’ uko ryamye hagati ya so na se; uti Non’ akurungikiye ifeza n’ izahabu: uti Genda ureke isezerano war’ ufitaniye na Bayasha umwami w’Abisirayeli, uti Kugira ngw amuvire mu gihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Beni‐hadadi yemerera umwami Asa, agomora abagabisha b’ingabo ziwe ngo baje gutera ibisagara vy’Abisirayeli; nuko batsinda Iyoni n’i Dani n’i Abeli‐mayimu n’ ibisagara vyose vy’ibigega vy’i Bunafutali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayasha avyumvise, areka kwubaka i Rama, aheba ivyo yahakorera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami Asa ahitana Abayuda bose, baja i Rama, bakūray’ amabuye n’ibiti, ivyo Bayasha yarikw arubakisha; maz’ avyubakisha i Geba n’i Misipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
