            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibindi vyose vyadonzwe kuri Asa, uhereye ku ca mbere ugashitsa ku c’imperēra, vyanditswe mu gitabo c’abami b’Abayuda n’ab’ Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ashitse mu mwaka ugira mirongwitatu n’ icenda ari ku ngoma arwara ibirenge, kand’ iyo ndwara imumerera nabi cane; ariko na ho nyene no mu ndwara yiwe ntiyaja kubaza Uhoraho, atar’ ukuja ku bavūzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Asa ahamvya ba sekuruza, atanga amaze imyaka mirongwine n’umwe ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
