            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamuhamba mu mva yiwe yiyimbishirije mu gisagara ca Dawidi, bamurambika ku buriri bguzuye ibintu bitāmirana n’ ibintu bimoga vy’amoko yose, vyinjijwe n’abahinga bābimogoreye; bamwosereza imibavu myinshi cane.",
          "type": "text",
